---
import Layout from "../../layouts/EditorialLayout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Editorial Policy">
  <div class="eyebrow">How we approach our content</div>
  <h1>Editorial Policy</h1>
  <div class="copy">
    <p>Our editorial goal is to make wellness information understandable without overstating evidence or promising medical outcomes.</p>
    <p>Articles should identify relevant sources, distinguish claims from established evidence, and disclose material commercial relationships.</p>
    <p>We do not present invented testimonials, fabricated studies, or unsupported medical claims as facts.</p>
    <p>Editorial processes will be refined as our publication grows. Corrections and updates should be reflected in affected articles.</p>
  </div>
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to homepage</a>
</Layout>
